{"id":"n64979-1-7","stage":5,"title":"숙면 · 熟睡","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64979-1-7-1","ko":"얼굴이 피곤해 보이는데 잠을 잘 못 잤어요?","zh":"你看起来很疲惫，是没睡好吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"얼굴이","meaning":"容貌","explanation":"얼굴：容貌；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼굴이","audio":"/audio/81669bb10178aa2a65c6.mp3"}},{"text":"피곤해","meaning":"疲倦，疲惫，困","explanation":"피곤하다：疲倦，疲惫，困；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"피곤하다","audio":"/audio/69e26389ae2a6e2f50d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60291","senseId":"1","lemma":"피곤하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"피곤해","audio":"/audio/658f643097f32b8076bb.mp3"}},{"text":"보이는데","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보이는데","audio":"/audio/9605d72ec6eda39718b1.mp3"}},{"text":"잠을","meaning":"觉，睡眠","explanation":"잠：觉，睡眠；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"잠","audio":"/audio/699e97260979403d2584.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70078","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잠을","audio":"/audio/76afcb272f116ce8b9ef.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"잤어요?","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잤어요","audio":"/audio/ade6406369e88b6c9bd9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"886ae927b512e2e4","term":"얼굴","zh":"容貌","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3","entryId":"17183","definition":"头部前面部分的整体长相或样子。","pronunciation":["얼굴"]},{"id":"69e26389ae2a6e2f","term":"피곤하다","zh":"疲倦，疲惫，困","audio":"/audio/69e26389ae2a6e2f50d8.mp3","entryId":"60291","definition":"身体或心里觉得累而筋疲力尽。","pronunciation":["피곤하다"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]},{"id":"699e97260979403d","term":"잠","zh":"觉，睡眠","audio":"/audio/699e97260979403d2584.mp3","entryId":"70078","definition":"指闭上眼睛，停止身体、精神活动而休息一会儿的状态。","pronunciation":["잠"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"023aa5fb34178979","term":"자다","zh":"睡，睡觉","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3","entryId":"69511","definition":"闭眼睛，停止身体、精神活动，一时进入休息状态。","pronunciation":["자다"]}],"audio":"/audio/53b52e77dc001d255f1f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64979-1-7-2","ko":"네. 요즘 더워서 숙면을 하기가 어렵네요.","zh":"是的。最近天气太热了，很难睡个好觉。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"더워서","meaning":"热，暑","explanation":"덥다：热，暑；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"덥다","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44484","senseId":"1","lemma":"덥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더워서","audio":"/audio/4fc1026c1fcc769f3258.mp3"}},{"text":"숙면을","meaning":"熟睡","explanation":"숙면：熟睡；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"숙면","audio":"/audio/00b8ab07a502100bb3e7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64979","senseId":"1","lemma":"숙면","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"숙면을","audio":"/audio/2fedeff2da890ace6532.mp3"}},{"text":"하기가","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하기가","audio":"/audio/aa96182367a4a58d1d98.mp3"}},{"text":"어렵네요.","meaning":"难，不容易","explanation":"어렵다：难，不容易；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"어렵다","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62232","senseId":"1","lemma":"어렵다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어렵네요","audio":"/audio/1e0fda47ae3181a59cc2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"038a0682ef015c0a","term":"덥다","zh":"热，暑","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3","entryId":"44484","definition":"体感气温高。","pronunciation":["덥ː따"]},{"id":"00b8ab07a502100b","term":"숙면","zh":"熟睡","audio":"/audio/00b8ab07a502100bb3e7.mp3","entryId":"64979","definition":"进入深度睡眠；或指此睡眠。","pronunciation":["숭면"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"55d0f08434308816","term":"어렵다","zh":"难，不容易","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3","entryId":"62232","definition":"做起来复杂或费力。","pronunciation":["어렵따"]}],"audio":"/audio/d682c1a78b1a094cce0d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.502,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=64979","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":169,"sequenceScore":3.3287,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你看起来很疲惫，是没睡好吗？","是的。最近天气太热了，很难睡个好觉。","你经常在这家餐厅点餐的原因是什么？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你看起来很疲惫，是没睡好吗？","是的。最近天气太热了，很难睡个好觉。","你经常在这家餐厅点餐的原因是什么？"],"answer":1}]}
